This branch is a modified version of Optimistix
(https://github.com/patrick-kidger/optimistix, Copyright Patrick Kidger and contributors),
via the fork by Khemraj Shukla (https://github.com/raj-brown/optimistix), which added the
SSBFGS and SSBroyden solvers. Both are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Modifications in this branch:
- optimistix/_solver/limited_memory_ssbroyden.py (new): LSSBroyden
- optimistix/_segments.py (new): minimise_segments, new_batch, samplers
- optimistix/_solver/quasi_newton.py (modified): direct form (use_inverse=False) of SSBroyden
- optimistix/__init__.py, optimistix/_solver/__init__.py (modified): exports
- tests/test_lssbroyden.py, test_segments.py, test_ss_step_length.py,
  test_ssbroyden_direct.py (new)
- LSSBROYDEN.md, NOTICE, benchmarks/pinn_poisson_lssbroyden.py (new); README.md (modified)
